### 
### 1. Create Customer
### Model: CustomerInput
POST {{base_url}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_code": "CUST-001",
  "full_name": "Jane Customer",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "phone": "081234567890",
  "address": "Jl. Internet No. 1",
  "latitude": -6.2088,
  "longitude": 106.8456,
  "status": "pending",
  "expiry_date": "2024-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "router_id": "{{router_id}}",
  "ppp_secret_name": "jane_secret",
  "ppp_secret_password": "jane_pass",
  "ppp_service": "pppoe",
  "profile_id": "{{profile_id}}",
  "billing_cycle": "monthly",
  "billing_day": 1,
  "tags": ["vip", "residential"]
}

### 
### 2. List Customers
### Model: CustomerFilter (Query Params)
GET {{base_url}}/customers?status=active&search=Jane
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 
### 3. Get Customer By ID
### Model: Customer
GET {{base_url}}/customers/{{customer_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 
### 4. Get Customer By Code (Public)
### Model: Customer
GET {{base_url}}/customers/by-code/CUST-001

### 
### 5. Update Customer
### Model: CustomerInput
PUT {{base_url}}/customers/{{customer_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Jane Customer Updated",
  "phone": "081234567899",
  "status": "active"
}

### 
### 6. Get Billing Info
GET {{base_url}}/customers/{{customer_id}}/billing-info
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 
### 7. Isolate Customer
POST {{base_url}}/customers/{{customer_id}}/isolate
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 
### 8. Activate Customer
POST {{base_url}}/customers/{{customer_id}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 
### 9. Delete Customer
DELETE {{base_url}}/customers/{{customer_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}